## Wood
component-wood = Wood
component-wood-made-of-part = cellulose
component-wood-made-of-part-2 = lignin
component-wood-description-novice = A natural material from trees. It conducts heat poorly, so wooden handles do not burn your hand.
component-wood-description-school = Wood conducts heat hundreds of times worse than metals. It burns, so keep it away from flames.
